his data."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Limiting the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/CodableConfiguration","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to statically-defined information protects clients from loading unexpected data, similar to the protection provided by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSSecureCoding"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the following example, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Message"},{"type":"text","text":" type uses "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@CodableConfiguration"},{"type":"text","text":" for an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString"},{"type":"text","text":" property called "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"type":"text","text":". While "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString"},{"type":"text","text":" does conform to "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/swift\/codable"},{"type":"text","text":", it can only encode its known attributes — those declared by the platform SDK — as part of this conformance. By adding a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/CodableConfiguration"},{"type":"text","text":" for the custom "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MyAttributes"},{"type":"text","text":" type, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Message"},{"type":"text","text":" uses "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/EncodableWithConfiguration\/encode(to:configuration:)"},{"type":"text","text":" when encoding "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"type":"text","text":", which preserves the custo